# MODFLOW name file compatible with these versions of MODFLOW:
# MODFLOW-2005, MODFLOW-NWT, MODFLOW One Water
#
# The Name File specifies the names of the input and output files, 
# associates each file name with a unit number and identifies the packages that will be used in the model
#
# The data is read like this:
#Package    UnitNumber    Filename
LIST           2           Example1.lst
DIS           11           Example1.dis 
OC            14           Example1.oc 
LPF           15           Example1.lpf 
BAS6          13           Example1.bas 
PCG           27           Example1.pcg 
CHD           24           Example1.chd 
WEL           20           Example1.wel 
DATA          51           Example1.hds REPLACE
